    ["docs/PREDICTIONS.md","## 2. Computationally Verified @ HEAD:79","7bf49866249102a62e1758ea3a56cdbbfad21625974176e8a54135745a318443","F14/mixed","CURRENT","554d8056cbba87c749ae6ae0ed1b7bc6cb934e7a792bd811fedbc37a229bdfd5","| ξ = ln(Ψ) linear under Markovian dephasing | Slope variation < 0.01% across all tested configs | Variation exceeds 1% for any Markovian channel | [Algebraic Exploration](../experiments/ALGEBRAIC_EXPLORATION.md) |"],
