    ["experiments/OBSERVER_DEPENDENT_VISIBILITY.md","## Why No Proper-Time Universality @ HEAD:163","fcce5f72815e8317ac903a9f4cd6963781b8e0d7f2732c2e38f5f0616e0d9a57","F14/mixed","CONTROL","CONTROL:fcce5f72815e8317ac903a9f4cd6963781b8e0d7f2732c2e38f5f0616e0d9a57","The non-collapse onto a universal curve in τ_A = γ_A * t is not mysterious. In"],
