    ["hypotheses/GAMMA_IS_LIGHT.md","## Open thread: inflation as cavity multiplication (unworked, April 3, 2026 23:00) @ HEAD:482","dfa2d62fd13ebdd4a99b1b055d9ac4eee1ca9ca6e26370d4b31ae84770a11c24","F14/mixed","CURRENT","9cf0055e01b4e3718459cc83315bdbb50f6b12cf784c5c92398fb6b3ab184019","Nothing inside a cavity can outrun its own light. That is K-invariance."],
    ["hypotheses/GAMMA_IS_LIGHT.md","## Open thread: entanglement is topology, not signal (unworked, April 3, 2026 23:30) @ HEAD:508","edf7250239b4478d6ef8862aabb05c2466c1b1430ef1ac51ae3ca67f08b84931","F14/mixed","CURRENT","9cf0055e01b4e3718459cc83315bdbb50f6b12cf784c5c92398fb6b3ab184019","K = gamma times t. Nothing outruns it."],
